     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font size=\"2\">我想填滿兩條折線圖間的面積</font><div><font size=\"2\">目前已知用<span style=\"background-color:rgb(51,51,51);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace\">geom_ribbon</span><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"> 可完成</font></span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">但之前用ggplot常常發生問題</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">因此想問是否有其他寫法?</font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">以下為我的原始碼data:DOE01 繪圖: plot</font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font color=\"#000000\"><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">DOE01&lt;- data[data$DOE_No == &quot;1&quot; &amp; data$Tool_ID == &quot;CEL01&quot;,]</font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">DOE01$Date=as.Date(DOE01$Date,format = &quot; %Y-%m-%d&quot;)</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">par(mar=c(10, 6, 4, 4) + 0.1)</font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">plot1&lt;-plot(x=DOE01$Date, y=DOE01$OUT, main=&quot;DOE01_CEL01&quot;, xlab=&quot;DATE&quot;,  ylab=&quot;MOVE&quot;,type=&quot;l&quot;,col=&quot;black&quot;,) </font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">par(new=T)</font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">plot2&lt;-plot(DOE01$Date,DOE01$WIP,axes=F, ylim=c(0,1000),xlab =&quot;&quot;,ylab=&quot;&quot;,type=&quot;l&quot;,col=&quot;blue3&quot;,)</font></div><div><font face=\"Menlo, Monaco, monospace\" size=\"2\">mtext(2,text=&quot;WIP&quot;,line=4,col=&quot;blue3&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,monospace;font-size:17px\"><br></div></font></span></div><div><br></div></div>"
